		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rain-thin, ghoulish figure with torn bat wings and a dog-like muzzle. Found in Leng. Consumes old bones.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Alien Mind</strong>. Immune to charm, sleep, and other mental effects.</p><p></p><p><strong>Charnel Deception</strong>. When still, looks like a corpse.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mutilate</strong>. Deals an extra die of damage if it hits the same target with both bites.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
